        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Deer Hunter is Back!\nDeer Hunter: Reloaded is a 1st person hunting simulation game based off of the #1 hunting franchise in the World. Deer Hunter will provide an authentic hunting experience for players as they venture to some of the top-rated hunting regions in North America from the plains of West Texas to the rugged terrain of Alaska.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "¡Deer Hunter ha vuelto!\nDeer Hunter: Reloaded es un simulador de caza en primera persona basado en la franquicia de caza número 1 del mundo. Deer Hunter ofrece una experiencia de caza auténtica mientras los jugadores recorren algunas de las regiones de caza mejor valoradas de Norteamérica, desde las llanuras del oeste de Texas hasta el terreno escarpado de Alaska.",
